Description: extra modules and scripts for CMake
 Extra CMake Modules extends CMake with modules, find modules, KDE build
 settings and toolchain helpers used throughout KDE software.
 .
 This SupraLINUX package follows KDE upstream stable and intentionally
 supersedes the older Ubuntu-provided KDE Frameworks version.
